rows.en:
"Where's the ampoule?"
"No idea. Why don't you look for it yourself?
You can hit me all you like, but isn't that just a waste of time?"{p}

The light was on in the night-duty room.
Yes!
Someone was in there!{p}

"Excuse me! Excuse me! Please! Open the door!"
...There was no answer.
Was the teacher out making the rounds right now?{p}

...Dead!
"Diiiiiie!"
Suddenly, a voice rang out.{p}

On reflex, I hurled the hammer at him.
"Ngh!"
As Shindo threw both hands up in front of his face to block it, I brought down the saw I was holding in my other hand.{p}

"Gyaah!"
The saw bit into Shindo's right hand, and he dropped the knife.
Without stopping, I slammed my body into him, knocked him down and straddled him.{p}

I arrived at the newspaper club room.
I couldn't hear any voices from inside.
Keeping an eye on my surroundings, I went into the club room.{p}
